! Loopback9 203.0.113.99= 偽装の送信元(インターネット側の番号を名乗る)・Loopback10 10.99.99.1= 誰も経路を持たない番号(uRPF の厳格と緩いの差を見る)。
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description to XR01
 ip address 172.20.1.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface Loopback0
 description customer LAN
 ip address 198.51.100.1 255.255.255.128
!
interface Loopback9
 description spoofed source (an internet address)
 ip address 203.0.113.99 255.255.255.255
!
interface Loopback10
 description spoofed source (no route anywhere)
 ip address 10.99.99.1 255.255.255.255
!
ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 172.20.1.254
!
